.TH sam-jail-args 1 2026-11-10 "SAM 0.1.0" "SAM Manual"
.SH NAME
sam\-jail\-args \- Show the extra arguments always passed to the app, or replace them with a JSON list on stdin (`\-\-stdin`)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsam\-jail args\fR [\fB\-\-stdin\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIAPP\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show the extra arguments always passed to the app, or replace them with a JSON list on stdin (`\-\-stdin`)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-stdin\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIAPP\fR>

